            "description": "# oap-rq\n\n\n\n## Getting started\n\nSimple Qmessiage Sender and Receiver using redis for python asyncio \n\n## installation\n\n- pip install oap-rq\n```\nfrom oap_rq.q import QBus\n\nq = QBus(redis, service=\"test\", queue=\"customer-food\")\nresp = await q.send({\"test\": \"me\"})\n\nprint(resp)\n\n```\n\n\n\n\n",
